# Episode 9: Neither

INT. VARMA HOUSE, DINING ROOM, JUBILEE HILLS - DAY

A long table, steel tumblers. LAKSHMI VARMA (50s) sweeps in with a box of sweets and a folded paper before the rice is even served.

LAKSHMI
మార్గశిరలో మంచి ముహూర్తం ఉంది, Padma గారు! పంతులు గారు మూడు dates ఇచ్చారు!

PADMA RAO (55) beams. Then her eyes fall on Meera's arm.

PADMA
Meeru... ఇదేంటి?

MEERA
చిన్న accident అమ్మా. Scooty జారింది. ఏం కాలేదు.

PADMA
(quiet)
ఎప్పుడు?

MEERA
...రెండు వారాలైంది.

Padma says nothing more. She sets her tumbler down very carefully. The hurt is total.

ARJUN, at the head of the table, glances between them. Then his phone buzzes.

ARJUN
Sorry, ఒక్క రెండు నిమిషాలు. Client.

He takes the call right there at the table, in English: "Yes, we can push the deck to Monday..."

Lakshmi keeps reading out dates. Meera watches Arjun: the same absence, in a nicer shirt.

EXT. VARMA HOUSE, GARDEN - DAY

Bougainvillea. Arjun comes out, pocketing his phone, contrite.

ARJUN
Sorry. Last time, promise.

MEERA
Arjun. Form లో నువ్వు correct గానే చూశావ్.

He goes still.

MEERA (CONT'D)
కానీ conclusion తప్పు. నేను వాడిని పిలిచేది వాడు perfect అని కాదు. నేను ఎవరినీ ఎక్కువ అడగలేదు కాబట్టి. నిన్ను కూడా.
(beat)
లేదు, Arjun.

A long moment. He nods, with dignity.

ARJUN
(soft)
తెలుసు. ఆ రోజు café లోనే తెలుసు.

He goes inside.

PADMA is behind a pillar. She has heard everything. She walks over to Meera.

PADMA
Accident గురించి నాకు చెప్పలేదు.
(beat)
నీ మనసు గురించి నీకే చెప్పుకోలేదు.

Meera's eyes fill. Padma takes her good hand.

PADMA (CONT'D)
నీ ఇష్టం, Meeru. నిజంగా నీ ఇష్టం.

INT. MEERA'S FLAT - NIGHT

Meera on the sofa with the hospital app open: "Update emergency contact?"

She types "Amma". Her thumb hovers over SAVE.

A notification slides down over it.

ON SCREEN: "Karthik shared a folder with you: work"

She taps it. A list loads: voice notes, all in her own voice. "Meera 03-Jan 1.12am". "Meera 14-Feb 12.58am". The count at the bottom reads 214.

She presses one. Her own sleepy voice fills the room.

MEERA (V.O.)
(recorded, laughing)
...నిద్ర రావట్లేదు. ఏదైనా మాట్లాడు, Karthik.

Meera puts her hand over her mouth.
